  "description": "Official .NET SDK for Guardhouse Cloud platform. Comprehensive authentication and authorization library supporting JWT signature validation (RFC 7515), token introspection (RFC 7662), and client credentials flow. Features include JWKS caching with lazy refresh, HTTP resilience with Polly, and protection against 10+ JWT security attack vectors including algorithm confusion, embedded key attacks, and psychic signature protection. Supports .NET 6.0 through .NET 10.0.",
